[{"title":"沁园春","author":"苏轼","text":"情若连环，恨如流水，甚时是休。\n也不须惊怪，沈郎易瘦，也不须惊怪，潘鬓先愁。\n总是难禁，许多魔难，奈好事教人不自由。\n空追想，念前欢杳杳，后会悠悠。\n凝眸。\n悔上层楼。\n谩惹起、新愁与旧愁。\n向彩笺写遍，相思字了，重重封卷，密寄书邮。\n料到伊行，时时开看，一看一回和泪收。\n须知道，□这般病染，两处心头。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77418,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"《归来引》送王子立归筠州","author":"苏轼","text":"归去来兮，世不汝求胡不归？\n汹北望之横流兮，渺西顾之尘霏。\n纷野马之决骤兮，幸余首之未鞿。\n出彭城而南骛兮，眷丘陇而增欷。\n乱清淮而俯鉴兮，惊昔容之是非。\n念东坡之遗老兮，轻千里而款余扉。\n共雪堂之清夜兮，揽明月之馀辉。\n曾鸡黍之未熟兮，叹空室之伊威。\n我挽袖而莫留兮，仆夫在门歌《式微》。\n归去来兮，路渺渺其何极。\n将税驾于何许兮，北江之南，南江之北。\n于此有人兮，俨峨峨其丰硕。\n孰居约而尔肥兮，非糠窍其何食。\n久抱一而不试兮，愈温温而自克。\n吾居世之荒浪兮，视昏昏而听默默。\n非之子莫振吾过兮，久不见恐自贼。\n吾欲往而道无由兮，子何畏而不即。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77419,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"黄泥坂词","author":"苏轼","text":"出临皋而东骛兮，并丛祠而北转。\n走雪堂之陂陀兮，历黄泥之长坂。\n大江汹以左缭兮，渺云涛之舒卷。\n草木层累而右附兮，蔚柯丘之葱茜。\n余旦往而夕还兮，步徙倚而盘桓。\n虽信美而不可居兮，苟娱余于一眄。\n余幼好此奇服兮，袭前人之诡幻。\n老更变而自哂兮，悟惊俗之来患。\n释宝璐而被缯絮兮，杂市人而无辨。\n路悠悠其莫往来兮，守一席而穷年。\n时游步而远览兮，路穷尽而旋反。\n朝嬉黄泥之白云兮，暮宿雪堂之青烟。\n喜鱼鸟之莫余惊兮，幸樵苏之我嫚。\n初被酒以行歌兮，忽放杖而醉偃。\n草为茵而块为枕兮，穆华堂之清宴。\n纷坠露之湿衣兮，升素月之团团。\n感父老之呼觉兮，恐牛羊之予践。\n于是蹶然而起，起而歌曰：月明兮星稀，迎余往兮饯余归。\n岁既宴兮草木腓，归来归来兮，黄泥不可以久嬉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77420,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"清溪词","author":"苏轼","text":"大江南兮九华西，泛秋浦兮乱清溪。\n水渺渺兮山无蹊，路重复兮居者迷。\n烂青红兮粲高低，松十里兮稻千畦。\n山无人兮云朝跻，霭濛濛兮渰凄凄。\n啸林谷兮号水泥，走鼪鼯兮下凫鹥。\n忽孤垒兮隐重堤，杳冥茫兮闻犬鸡。\n郁万瓦兮鸟翼齐，浮轩楹兮飞棋枅。\n雁南归兮寒蜩嘶，弄秋水兮挹玻璃。\n朝市合兮杂髦齯，挟箪瓢兮佩锄犁。\n鸟兽散兮相扶携，隐惊雷兮骛长霓。\n望翠微兮古招提，挂木杪兮翔云梯。\n若有人兮怅幽栖，石为门兮云为闺。\n块虚堂兮法喜妻，呼猿狙兮子鹿麛。\n我欲往兮奉杖藜，独长啸兮谢阮、嵇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77421,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"醉落魄 述怀","author":"苏轼","text":"醉醒醒醉。\n凭君会取这滋味。\n浓斟琥珀香浮蚁。\n一到愁肠，别有阳春意。\n须将幕席为天地。\n歌前起舞花前睡。\n从他落魄陶陶里。\n犹胜醒醒，惹得闲憔悴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77422,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"上清词","author":"苏轼","text":"南山之幽，云冥冥兮。\n孰居此者，帝侧之神君。\n君胡为兮山之幽，顾宫殿兮久淹留。\n又曷为一朝去此而不顾兮，悲此空山之人也。\n来不可得而知兮，去固不可得而讯也。\n君之来兮天门空，从千骑兮驾飞龙。\n隶辰星兮役太岁，俨昼降兮雷隆隆。\n朝发轸兮帝庭，夕弭节兮山宫。\n懭有妖兮虐下士，精为星兮气为虹。\n爱流血之滂沛兮，又嗜疟疠与螟虫。\n啸盲风而涕淫雨兮，时又吐旱火之爞融。\n衔帝命以下讨兮，建千仞之修锋。\n乘飞霆而追逸景兮，歙砉扫灭而无踪。\n忽崩播其来会兮，走海岳之神公。\n龙车兽鬼不知其数兮，旗纛晻霭而冥蒙。\n渐俯伛以旅进兮，锵剑佩之相砻。\n司杀生之必信兮，知上帝之不汝容。\n既约束以反职兮，退战慄而愈恭。\n泽充塞于四海兮，独澹然其无功。\n君之去兮天门开，款阊阖兮朝玉台。\n群仙迎兮塞云汉，俨前导兮纷后陪。\n历玉阶兮帝迎劳，君良苦兮马豗颓。\n闵人世兮迫隘，陈下土兮帝所哀。\n返琼宫之嵯峨兮，役万灵之喧豗。\n默清净以无为兮，时节狩于斗魁。\n诣通明而献黜陟兮，轶荡荡其无回。\n忽表里之焕霍兮，光下烛于九垓。\n时游目以下览兮，五岳为豆，四溟为杯。\n俯故宫之千柱兮，若毫端之集埃。\n来非以为乐兮，去非以为悲。\n谓神君之既返兮，曾颜咫尺之不违。\n升秘殿以内悸兮，魂凛凛而上驰。\n忽寤寐以有得兮，敢沐浴而献辞。\n是耶非耶，臣不可得而知也。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77423,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山坡陀行","author":"苏轼","text":"山坡陀兮下属江，势崖绝兮游波所荡如颓墙。\n松茀律兮百尺旁，拔此惊葛藟之。\n上不见日兮下可依，吾曳杖兮吾僮亦吾之书随。\n藐余望兮水中坻，颀然而长者黄冠而羽衣。\n浣颐坦腹盘石箕坐兮，山亦有趾安不危，四无人兮可忘饥。\n仙人偓佺自言其居瑶之圃，一日一夜飞相往来不可数。\n使其开口言兮，岂惟河汉无极惊余心。\n默不言兮，蹇昭氏之不鼓琴。\n憺将山河与日月长在，若有人兮，梦中仇池我归路。\n此非小有兮，噫乎何以乐此而不去。\n昔余游于葛天兮，身非陶氏犹与偕。\n乘渺茫良未果兮，仆夫悲余马怀。\n聊逍遥兮容与，晞余发兮兰之渚。\n余论世兮千载一人犹并时，余行诘曲兮欲知余者稀。\n峨峨洋洋余方乐兮，譬余系舟于水，鱼潜鸟举亦不知。\n何必每念辄得，应余若响，坐有如此兮人子期。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77424,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵借观《睢阳老五图》","author":"苏轼","text":"国老安荣心自闲，紫袍金带旧簪冠。\n星骑箕簸扬糠秕秕，斗掌权衡表汉桓。\n冬有愆阳嫌薄热，夏多沴气畏轻寒。\n赖得五贤清雅出，俾人敬慕肃容看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77425,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题金山寺回文体","author":"苏轼","text":"潮随暗浪雪山倾，远浦渔舟钓月明。\n桥对寺门松径小，槛当泉眼石波清。\n迢迢绿树江天晓，霭霭红霞晚日晴。\n遥望四边云接水，碧峰千点数鸥轻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77426,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"补子瞻赠姜唐佐秀才","author":"苏辙","text":"生长茅间有异芳，风流稷下古诸姜。\n适从琼管鱼龙窟，秀出羊城翰墨场。\n沧海何曾断地脉，白袍端合破天荒。\n锦衣他日千人看，始信东坡眼力长。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77427,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"水月寺","author":"苏轼","text":"千尺长松挂薜萝，梯云岭上一声歌。\n湖山深秀有何处，水月池中桂影多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77428,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"半月泉","author":"苏轼","text":"请得一日假，来游半月泉。\n何人施大手，擘破水中天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77429,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"游何山","author":"苏轼","text":"今日何山是胜游，乱峰萦转绕沧洲。\n云含老树明还灭，石碍飞泉咽复流。\n遍岭烟霞迷俗客，一溪风雨送归舟。\n自嗟尘土先衰老，底事孤僧亦白头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77430,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"自题临文与可画竹","author":"苏轼","text":"石室先生清兴动，落笔纵横飞小凤。\n借君妙意写筼筜，留与诗人发吟讽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77431,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"宝墨亭","author":"苏轼","text":"山阴不见换鹅经，京口空传《瘗鹤铭》。\n潇洒谪仙来作郡，风流太守为开亭。\n两篇玉蕊尘初涤，四体银钩迹尚青。\n我久临池无所得，愿观遗法快沉冥。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77432,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"双井白龙","author":"苏轼","text":"岩泉未入井，蒙然冒沙石。\n泉嫩石为厌，石老生罅隙。\n异哉寸波中，露此横海脊。\n先生酌泉笑，泉秀神龙蛰。\n举手玉箸插，忽去银钉掷。\n大身何时布，大翮翔霹雳。\n谁言鹏背大，更觉宇宙窄。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77433,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"瑞金东明观","author":"苏轼","text":"浮金最好溪南景，古木楼台画不成。\n天籁远兼流水韵，云璈常听步虚声。\n青鸾白鹤蟠空下，翠草玄芝匝地生。\n咫尺仙都隔尘世，门前车马任纵横。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77434,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题清淮楼","author":"苏轼","text":"观鱼惠子台芜没，梦蝶庄生冢木秋。\n惟有清淮供四望，年年依旧背城流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77435,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"晓出净慈送林子方二首 其二","author":"杨万里","text":"毕竟西湖六月中，风光不与四时同。\n接天莲叶无穷碧，映日荷花别样红。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77436,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"戏答佛印","author":"苏轼","text":"远公沽酒饮陶潜，佛印烧猪待子瞻。\n采得百花成蜜后，不知辛苦为谁甜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77437,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题三首 其一","author":"苏轼","text":"木落沙明秋浦，云卧烟淡潇湘。\n曾学扁舟范蠡，五湖深处鸣榔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77438,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题三首 其二","author":"苏轼","text":"望断水云千里，横空一抹晴岚。\n不见邯郸归路，梦中略到江南。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77439,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题三首 其三","author":"苏轼","text":"公子只应见画，此中我独知津。\n写到水穷天杪，定非尘土间人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77440,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"来鹤亭","author":"苏轼","text":"鸿渐偏宜丹凤南，冠霞帔月影毵毵。\n酒酣亭上来看舞，有客新名唤作耽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77441,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘顗宫苑，退老于庐山石碑庵，顗，陕西人，本进士换武，家有声伎 其二","author":"苏轼","text":"彫弓挂壁耻言勋，笑人渔樵便作群。\n五马亲来看射虎，不愁醉尉恼将军。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77442,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"刘顗宫苑，退老于庐山石碑庵，顗，陕西人，本进士换武，家有声伎 其三","author":"苏轼","text":"肩舆已弃蹑风骓，旧物犹存杨柳枝。\n一曲清商近尤好，五陵豪气未全衰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77443,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙山补亡，并引 其一","author":"苏轼","text":"征西天府，重九令节。\n驾言龙山，宴凯群哲。\n壶歌雅奏，缓带轻帢。\n胡为中觞，一笑粲发。\n楩楠竞秀，榆柳独脱。\n骥騄交骛，驽蹇先蹶。\n楚狂醉乱，陨帽莫觉。\n戎服囚首，枯颅茁发。\n惟明将军，度量豁达。\n容此下士，颠倒冠袜。\n宰夫杨觯，兕觥举罚。\n请歌《相鼠》，以侑此爵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77444,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"龙山补亡，并引 其二","author":"苏轼","text":"吾闻君子，蹈常履素。\n晦明风雨，不改其度。\n平生丘壑，散发箕裾。\n坠车天全，颠沛何惧。\n腰适忘带，足适忘屦。\n不知有我，帽复奚数。\n流水莫系，浮云暂寓。\n飘然随风，非去非取。\n我冠明月，佩服宝璐。\n不缨而结，不簪而附。\n歌诗宁择，请饮《相鼠》。\n罚此陋人，俾出童羖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77445,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"苏轼","text":"小槛徘徊日自斜，只愁春尽委泥沙。\n丹青欲写倾城色，世上今无杨子华。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77446,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"大司成颜几圣率同舍招游裴园泛舟绕孤山赏荷花晚泊玉壶得十绝句 其七","author":"杨万里","text":"城中担上买莲房，未抵西湖泛野航。\n旋折荷花剥莲子，露为风味月为香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77447,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西湖寿星院明远堂","author":"苏轼","text":"十年不向此凭栏，景象依然一望间。\n龙蜃吐云天入水，楼台倒影日衔山。\n僧于僻寺难为隐，人在扁舟未是闲。\n孤鹤似寻和靖宅，盘空飞去复飞还。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77448,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"牡丹和韵","author":"苏轼","text":"光风为花好，奕奕弄清温。\n撩理莺情趣，留连蝶梦魂。\n饮酣浮倒晕，舞倦怯新翻。\n水竹傍○意，明红似故园。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77449,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈云四景 其一 甘露泉","author":"苏轼","text":"阶下有龙潭，一泓寒且碧。\n不须抚两掌，流出仙人液。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77450,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈云四景 其二 白云居","author":"苏轼","text":"禅居何所有，户牖白云分。\n直待谭玄后，相随花雨纷。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77451,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈云四景 其三 娑罗树","author":"苏轼","text":"谁从五竺国，分得一枝来。\n秀出重楼外，专除世上埃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77452,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"慈云四景 其四 鹦鹉院","author":"苏轼","text":"古院枫篁里，寥寥隔市喧。\n仙禽发异响，惊起老僧禅。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77453,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"过金山寺一首","author":"苏轼","text":"明月妙高台，盘涡月照开。\n琳宫龙久住，珠树鹤能来。\n云雾空中绕，帆樯槛外回。\n无言卷石小，江左拟蓬莱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77454,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题二首 其一","author":"苏轼","text":"足蹑平都古洞天，此身不觉到云间。\n抬眸四顾乾坤阔，日月星辰任我攀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77455,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"失题二首 其二","author":"苏轼","text":"平都天下古名山，自信山中岁月闲。\n午梦任随鸠唤觉，早朝又听鹿催班。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77456,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪诗八首 其一","author":"苏轼","text":"石泉冻合竹无风，夜色沉沉万境空。\n试问静中闲侧耳，隔窗撩乱扑春虫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77457,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪诗八首 其二","author":"苏轼","text":"闲来披氅学王恭，姑射群仙邂逅逢。\n只为肌肤酷相似，绕庭无处觅行踪。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77458,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪诗八首 其三","author":"苏轼","text":"半夜欺陵范叔袍，更兼风力助威豪。\n地炉火暖犹无奈，怪得山林酒价高。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77459,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪诗八首 其四","author":"苏轼","text":"儿童龟手握轻明，斩碾枪旗入鼎烹。\n拟欲为之修《水记》，惠山泉冷酿泉清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪诗八首 其五","author":"苏轼","text":"天工呈瑞足人心，平地今闻一尺深。\n此为丰年报消息，满田何止万黄金。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪诗八首 其六","author":"苏轼","text":"海风吹浪去无边，倏忽凝为万顷田。\n五月凉尘渴人肺，不知价值几多钱。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"雪诗八首 其七","author":"苏轼","text":"高下横斜薄又浓，破窗疏户苦相攻。\n莫言造物浑无意，好丑都来失旧容。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又两绝 其一","author":"苏颂","text":"江天惨淡物华新，四望漫漫起玉尘。\n但怪长衢已盈尺，岂知闭户有高人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"又两绝 其二","author":"苏颂","text":"看雪宜临广路津，年年光景见长新。\n不知滋液功多少，且慰东皋首种人。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后閤春帖子六首 其六","author":"苏颂","text":"上寿春朝观外庭，诏恩不许会公卿。\n即时二史书谦德，只使群官进姓名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后閤春帖子六首 其五","author":"苏颂","text":"荆楚牛人驱厉气，安丰枣腊祀苍精。\n圣朝虽举前朝事，不为禳祈为劝耕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后閤春帖子六首 其四","author":"苏颂","text":"冬后五旬逢岁朔，腊前三白遍民田。\n朝来淑气先时至，又见春秋大有年。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后閤春帖子六首 其三","author":"苏颂","text":"宝历书推律，春觞颂献椒。\n年年似今日，三万八千朝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后閤春帖子六首 其二","author":"苏颂","text":"圣诏颁宽大，天恩遍迩遐。\n雷风孚号令，草木动萌芽。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"太皇太后閤春帖子六首 其一","author":"苏颂","text":"气至风条达，阳升土坟盈。\n芸芸生物遂，两两泰阶平。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夫人閤春帖子四首 其四","author":"苏颂","text":"君王崇俭化邦家，禁掖承恩绝泰奢。\n只拟讨寻钩盾籍，何曾雕刻上林花。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夫人閤春帖子四首 其三","author":"苏颂","text":"良辰孟月辰新阳，和气中宵遍未央。\n不待望春宫转漏，便趋崇庆殿称觞。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夫人閤春帖子四首 其二","author":"苏颂","text":"岁近寒风薄，宫深爱日迟。\n欲知春到处，梅杏有新枝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"夫人閤春帖子四首 其一","author":"苏颂","text":"晓漏催银烛，新春趁贺朝。\n御香烟馥郁，宫佩影飘飖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬夕会诸同僚与税舍弟郡斋饮话通判欧郎中以二绝句纪事见寄次韵 其一","author":"苏颂","text":"弟兄叨郡两淮间，宾友衔杯午夜欢。\n喜听话言消酒力，更钦风义敌霜寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"冬夕会诸同僚与税舍弟郡斋饮话通判欧郎中以二绝句纪事见寄次韵 其二","author":"苏颂","text":"立朝才薄幸潜郎，出守恩优便养堂。\n赖得同僚借河润，坐令尸禄荷龙光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵孔平仲学士详定次口占","author":"苏颂","text":"多士盈廷待指南，老枚何幸接徐严。\n子亭覆实参高议，时引清风拂画檐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77478,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵叶希虞秘校同游天竺寺五绝句 其二","author":"苏颂","text":"鹫峰何代落山隈，每到须清一世埃。\n叹息俗缘常窘束，半年才得两回来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77479,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵叶希虞秘校同游天竺寺五绝句 其四","author":"苏颂","text":"丛林涧水尽萦回，岩室云房不染埃。\n若使此中容小隐，会须卜筑赋归来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":77480,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}}]